      <tr><td>The question the import window asks before it loads profiles</td><td>“Import from OrcaSlicer: unsaved changes” opens</td><td><span class="tag" data-k="answer">Answered</span> No window. A version is saved, the import goes on, the change is dropped.</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Code selects the Calibration page</td><td>The main window shows OrcaSlicer's Calibration page</td><td><span class="tag" data-k="stop">Refused</span> The main window stays on Prepare.</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Ctrl+Tab, pressed three times</td><td>Preview, then Project, then Calibration</td><td><span class="tag" data-k="stop">Refused</span> Project, Home, Prepare. Preview, Device and Calibration were each refused.</td></tr>
