  </table></div>

  <h3>The existing harness modes with the prototype on</h3>
  <div class="scroll"><table>
    <thead><tr><th>Mode</th><th>Prototype off</th><th>Prototype on</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td>Default</td><td>634 checks pass, twice. One earlier run stalled at the Check print window.</td><td>634 checks pass, twice</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>--dialog-routing</code></td><td>117 pass</td><td>1 fails: it expects the slice error box to show, which the prototype takes</td></tr>
