  <p>A new harness scenario makes OrcaSlicer say each thing through its real code. The fake Bambu printer refuses a connection and a print job. A real upload goes to a closed port. The right-click menu's own split command runs. With the prototype off, the app behaves as it does today, and every case reproduced today's window: 163 checks, none failed. With it on: 189 checks, none failed. Both were run twice.</p>
